  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s291/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s16000/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2 style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></h2><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">🎈 שיחה בסמלים - חַגֵּי יִשְׂרָאֵל</span></h2><h3 data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"333\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🕯️ שַׁבָּת אָמְרָה:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">אֲנִי בָּאָה כָּל שָׁבוּעַ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">אֵינִי תָּלוּיָה בְּתַאֲרִיךְ וְלֹא בְּיָרֵחַ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🛑&nbsp;עוֹצְרִים,&nbsp;נָחִים&nbsp;וְזוֹכְרִים שֶׁהָעוֹלָם לֹא רָץ כָּל הַזְּמַן.</span></span></p></h3><h3 data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"333\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🍪<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;פֶּסַח אָמַר:<br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אֲנִי מוֹעֵד שֶׁל יְצִיאָה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">🚪</span></span>⬅️&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">יָצָאנוּ מֵעַבְדוּת לְחֵרוּת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אוֹכְלִים מַצָּה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">וְזוֹכְרִים שֶׁגַּם דֶּרֶךְ קָשָׁה יְכוֹלָה לְהִסְתַּיֵּם בְּטוֹב.</span></span></span></h3><h3 data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"333\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🌾 סְפִירַת הָעֹמֶר לָחֲשָׁה:<br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אֲנִי לֹא יוֹם אֶחָד -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אֲנִי סְפִירָה.</span><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">🔢&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">סוֹפְרִים לֹא בְּרִיצָה,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אֶלָּא בְּסַבְלָנוּת.</span></span></h3><h3 data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"333\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">📜 שָׁבוּעוֹת אָמַר:<br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אֲנִי מוֹעֵד שֶׁל מַתָּנָה.<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🧠❤️&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">קִבַּלְנוּ תּוֹרָה -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">לָדַעַת וּלְקַיֵּם בְּאַהֲבָה.</span></span></span></h3><h3 data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"333\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🎺 רֹאשׁ הַשָּׁנָה אָמַר:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">אֲנִי הַתְחָלָה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">קוֹל שׁוֹפָר מְעוֹרֵר.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🧭&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">עוֹצְרִים וְשׁוֹאֲלִים:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">לְאָן אֲנַחְנוּ הוֹלְכִים הַשָּׁנָה?</span></span></h3><h3 data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"333\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🤍 יוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים לָחַשׁ:<br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אֲנִי יוֹם שֶׁל לֵב.</span><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">🛑🍽️&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">עוֹצְרִים מֵאֲכִילָה&nbsp;כְּדֵי לְהַקְשִׁיב </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">לַנְּשָׁמָה</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">.</span><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">מְבַקְּשִׁים סְלִיחָה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">וּמַתְחִילִים מֵחָדָשׁ.</span></span></h3><h3 data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"333\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌿 סֻכּוֹת אָמַר:<br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אֲנִי מוֹעֵד שֶׁל שִׂמְחָה פְּשׁוּטָה.</span><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">🏠</span></span>⬅️<span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🌿&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">יוֹצְאִים מִן הַבַּיִת&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">לְסֻכָּה קְטַנָּה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">לֹּא הַכֹּל קִירוֹת -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">יֵשׁ גַּם שִׂמְחָה בְּפָּשׁוּט.</span></span></h3><h3 data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"333\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">💧 שְׁמִינִי עֲצֶרֶת אָמַר:<br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אֲנִי יוֹם שֶׁל קִרְבָה.</span><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">🤲&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">אַחֲרֵי כָּל הַמּוֹעֲדוֹת -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">עוֹד רֶגַע יַחַד.</span><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">מַזְכִּירִים גֶּשֶׁם&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">וְזוֹכְרִים שֶׁהַכֹּל תָּלוּי בִּבְרָכָה.</span></span></h3><h3 data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"333\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">✨&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אָמְרוּ&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַמּוֹעֲדוֹת יַחַד:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">אֲנַחְנוּ לֹא רַק יָמִים בַּלּוּחַ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🗓️</span>⬅️<span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">❤️&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">אֲנַחְנוּ רְגָעִים שֶׁמְּלַמְּדִים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">אֵיךְ לִחְיוֹת יָפֶה יוֹתֵר.</span></span></h3><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תפזורת מועדות</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו את 🔍 המועדות&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מהפרשה: שַׁבַּת, פֶּסַח, עֹמֶר, בִּכֻּרִים, תְּרוּעָה, כִּפֻּרִים, סֻּכּוֹת, עֲצֶרֶת.</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br />בכיוונים ⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span><br /><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiHNo6I-na_DISTm_WIL5R6fuUTLhFVc9mbPYi1ucihHjCws69dQdGdUZqhp-hKoU8uepybhqDBujN7JNAaHw5SSlbcGGAiZcfQTvhAJpEu5KMjJIlx8V1kul9N4IVx7-WY3ZMqbLI3yWc8EBkBJ-jtq_zZpN6fXJPnAHMJ6GzBFJ13_9c0uCY1LTKUJ1U/s465/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiHNo6I-na_DISTm_WIL5R6fuUTLhFVc9mbPYi1ucihHjCws69dQdGdUZqhp-hKoU8uepybhqDBujN7JNAaHw5SSlbcGGAiZcfQTvhAJpEu5KMjJIlx8V1kul9N4IVx7-WY3ZMqbLI3yWc8EBkBJ-jtq_zZpN6fXJPnAHMJ6GzBFJ13_9c0uCY1LTKUJ1U/s320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></a><br /><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></h2><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּפָרָשַׁת אֱמֹר, נֶאֶמְרוּ דִּינִים מְיֻחָדִים לַכֹּהֲנִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כֹּהֵן רָגִיל רַשַּׁאי לְהִטָּמֵא לִקְרוֹבֵי מִשְׁפַּחְתּוֹ הַקְּרוֹבִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כֹּהֵן גָּדוֹל רַשַּׁאי לְהִטָּמֵא לְאָבִיו וְאִמּוֹ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בַּעַל מוּם יָכוֹל לַעֲבֹד בַּעֲבוֹדַת הַקָּרְבָּנוֹת בַּמִּקְדָּשׁ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָסוּר לֶאֱכֹל קָרְבָּן כְּשֶׁהָאָדָם טָמֵא?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חַג הַפֶּסַח חָל תָּמִיד בְּאוֹתוֹ יוֹם בְּשָׁבוּעַ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חַג הַשָּׁבוּעוֹת קָשׁוּר לִסְפִירַת הָעֹמֶר?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רֹאשׁ הַשָּׁנָה נִקְרָא בַּתּוֹרָה “יוֹם תְּרוּעָה”?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּיוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים מְצַוָּה הַתּוֹרָה לְהִתְעַנּוֹת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חַג הַסֻּכּוֹת נִמְשַׁךְ יוֹם אֶחָד בִּלְבַד?</span></li></ol>"
}
